<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria to sell forex at 83 naira to dollar.</title>
<headline>Nigeria to sell forex at 83 naira to dollar.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's central bank is to offer foreign exchange at the rate of 83.0 naira to the dollar at its Wednesday sale against 83.2 naira to the dollar last week, a central bank spokesman said.</p>
<p>The central bank has maintained a policy of gradually strengthening the naira over the past month, from its previously stable level of 85 naira to the dollar. The bank has not said what it considers to be a desirable value for the currency.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 2630317.</p>
</text>
